  "tandemSoGehts": [
    "Cut the cards in the middle. Partner A takes the left half, Partner B takes the right half.",
    "A builds question 1 from the tiles and asks it: “Este presente é para mim?” (Put the verb in the right form.)",
    "B hears the question and builds the answer. After a preposition, Portuguese uses mim and ti, not eu and tu: para mim, sem ti. The other persons stay the same: com ele, para ela, sem nós. With com there are special forms: comigo, contigo, connosco. De or em plus ele or ela contract: dele, nela. So change the tiles preposition + pronoun into the right form. A tile in brackets such as (eu) says who is meant; you don’t write it.",
    "Then B asks question 2 and A answers. Take turns. At the end, check with the answer sheet.",
    "Last, swap cards and do it all again, faster."
  ],
